     Format language data to match Open Library's expected format.
     For an input of ["eng", "fre"], return:
     [{'key': '/languages/eng'}, {'key': '/languages/fre'}]
+    ISO-639-1 codes and language names resolve to MARC codes; repeated
+    languages are returned once in their first-seen order.
     """
     if not languages:
